# Markdown links in an answer (`.prd/tui-phase4` F5 links): an inline link,
# a bare URL, an angle autolink and an email one, a URL in a code span, links
# with a relative target, a `javascript:` and an `ftp:` scheme (linked by fx,
# text by xfx -- the scheme rule in `src/tui/hyperlink.rs`), a link whose text
# wraps past the row's edge, and a link in a table cell. Then the full
# transcript (Ctrl-O, closed with Ctrl-O), a second answer whose link takes
# the next id, and a relaunch that replays the session.
gateway links-turns.json
wait 4
type show me the links
key Enter
wait 6
snap answered
key C-o
wait 1.5
snap full
key C-o
wait 1.5
type and one more
key Enter
wait 5
snap second
snapfull second
keep
type /quit
key Enter
wait 2
fx: relaunch --resume-last
xfx: relaunch --resume last
wait 6
snap resumed
snapfull resumed
